---

<BlogArticleShell
  title="Canada (CBSA) Special: 2026 Declaration & Inspection Guide | kakobuy-cn.com"
  description="Targeted advice for Canadian spreadsheet buyers facing increased CBSA scrutiny in 2026, featuring specific keyword and value-threshold recommendations."
  canonicalPath={canonicalPath}
  headline="Canada (CBSA) Special: Declaration strategies for 2026 haul inspections"
  publishedISO={publishedISO}
  displayDate="18 May 2026"
  structuredKeywords={[
    'CBSA customs declaration guide',
    'Canada reps shipping 2026',
    'declaring hauls to Canada',
    'Canada Post vs UPS customs',
